### CelebraHub - Proveedores - UPDATE

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

### Actualizacion completa con PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/proveedores/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nit": "900123456-7",
  "razon_social": "Eventos y Suministros SAS",
  "contacto": "Ana Perez",
  "telefono": "3001234567",
  "email": "ventas@eventos.example",
  "is_active": true
}

###

### Actualizacion parcial con PATCH
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/proveedores/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telefono": "3109876543"
}